<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The project is for the widening, improvement, <strong>maintenance and operation of Routes 202 and 206</strong> in the Los Ríos region. At 44.3 km and 43.1 km long, respectively, both are planned as two-lane highways with service speeds of 120 km/h and 100 km/h, with occasional 80 km/h areas.</p>
<p>The project includes<strong> replacing existing bridges and constructing new bridges</strong>, as well as pedestrian walkways, bus stops, and interchanges.</p>
