<p><span data-sheets-root="1">The proposal involves the development of two lines. The first will connect downtown Talcahuano with the Mirador del Pacífico area, with stops at Cerro Cornou and the Antenas and Centinela II sectors, and five stations across a 1.8-mile route. The second line will transport passengers from the Antenas station on line 1 to the Los Lobos area, with a 0.8-mile route.</span></p>
