<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>This project aims to recover and promote <strong>rail connectivity between Valparaíso and Santiago </strong>by gradually developing a railway and connecting districts with poor accessibility —e.g., Tiltil, La Calera and Llay Llay—with the regional capitals. The concession <strong>will favor existing rail infrastructure and complement the rail network</strong> with a high standard and level of service.<br><br><br></p>
