<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The new facility will be located on state-owned land near Route 5 North, approximately 40 kilometers (25 miles) northwest of the city of Copiapó and 14 kilometers (9 miles) south of the Desierto de Atacama Airport, in the Atacama Region. <br>The architectural proposal includes a total area of approximately<strong> 76,600 m2, with an estimated capacity of 2,160 inmates</strong>, distributed across 15 detention modules.</p>
